│ patch_description        │ Building on the proven 2-parameter group-sharing RY/RZ backbone, we replace the open CZ   │
│                          │ chain with a closed ring (adding the wrap-around edge 7→0 for full symmetric              │
│                          │ connectivity) and replace every second edge in that ring with a shared-parameter XX(θ)    │
