│                          │ trainable parameter added to the existing 2 group parameters) while giving the circuit a  │
│                          │ tunable, globally shared two-qubit interaction strength that can help it separate classes │
│                          │ non-trivially beyond what fixed CZ alone provides. The ring topology also removes the     │
│                          │ asymmetry between end qubits (0 and 7) and interior qubits present in the open chain,     │
│                          │ which should aid generalization from very few training examples.                          │
