│                          │ "theta" across both the pre- and post-entanglement rotation layers and relied entirely on │
│                          │ fixed (parameter-free) entangling gates, achieving strong parameter economy (n_params=8). │
│                          │ The current candidate regressed to 3 distinct parameter names (ry_global, xx_ent,         │
