│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ two_shared_params_crz_entangler                                                           │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the 3-parameter design (ry_global, xx_ent, rz_global) with a leaner 2-parameter   │
│                          │ design as suggested: a single shared rotation parameter "theta1" drives all single-qubit  │
│                          │ RY (pre) and RZ (post) rotations across all 8 qubits, while a second shared parameter     │
│                          │ "theta2" drives a fixed-topology entangling layer of parametrized CRZ gates placed on the │
│                          │ antipodal (distance-4) and skip-2 (distance-2) links. This reduces the per-block          │
│                          │ unique-parameter count from 3 to 2 (a ~33% cut), while the CRZ entangler (versus the      │
│                          │ mixed XX/CZ layer) gives every qubit two non-local parametrized entangling partners plus  │
│                          │ two additional fixed-free skip-2 CRZ links, preserving expressivity needed to entangle    │
│                          │ the whole register with minimal parameters. This directly tests whether a slightly        │
│                          │ richer, but still highly economical, entangling layer can restore the higher combined     │
│                          │ score (0.80) seen in the 1-parameter seeds while still allowing some flexibility beyond a │
│                          │ single global scalar.                                                                     │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0453                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 1; deleted: 0; modified: 34;                                                       │
