                         Patch Metadata - Gen 56/80 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Introduce a second shared parameter for the entangling layer, decoupling it from the      │
│                          │ single-qubit rotation angle. Currently the CRZ long-range entangling layer reuses the     │
│                          │ same "theta" parameter as the RX/RY/RZ rotation layers, forcing rotation angle and        │
│                          │ entanglement strength to be tied together. By giving the CRZ layer its own shared         │
│                          │ parameter "theta_e" (still shared across all 8 wires, so only +1 trainable parameter      │
│                          │ total, n_params=2), the circuit gains an independent degree of freedom to tune            │
│                          │ entanglement strength separately from single-qubit rotation angle. This should help push  │
│                          │ past the apparent single-parameter expressivity ceiling (score plateaued at 0.80) while   │
│                          │ keeping the parameter count essentially minimal (2 total), preserving strong parameter    │
│                          │ efficiency and likely improving validation/test loss without hurting accuracy or          │
│                          │ convergence speed.                                                                        │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0204                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 0; deleted: 0; modified: 1;                                                        │
