│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ dual_stacked_theta_block_with_skip2                                                       │
│ patch_description        │ Building on the observation that adding the skip-2 CZ sub-ring (step 2b in the earlier    │
│                          │ 30-step-convergence seed) dramatically cut convergence steps (30 vs. 120) without         │
│                          │ changing accuracy or parameter count, and following the recommendation to stack a second  │
│                          │ copy of the compact entangling block while reusing the SAME single shared parameter       │
│                          │ "theta", this edit: (1) restores the lightweight skip-2 CZ ring (0-2,2-4,4-6,6-0) that    │
│                          │ was dropped in the current candidate, and (2) duplicates the entire RX→RY→(XX/CZ          │
│                          │ ring)→skip-2 CZ→antipodal CZ→RZ block back-to-back within the same repetition, still      │
│                          │ reusing "theta" everywhere. This keeps the trainable-parameter count identical (n_params  │
│                          │ stays at 8, one per outer repetition) while roughly doubling circuit depth/expressivity,  │
│                          │ which prior experiments show speeds up convergence substantially at essentially no        │
│                          │ parameter cost — directly targeting the "converge in fewer steps" criterion of the        │
│                          │ combined score.                                                                           │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0551                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
