│                          │ keeping the fixed antipodal CZ shortcuts and existing structure intact. The added CRY     │
│                          │ layer should improve expressivity/generalization beyond the pure-CZ skip topology used    │
│                          │ previously, and reusing "theta_e" across all skip-2 links keeps parameter count minimal   │
