│                          │ while turning every ring edge into a tunable, non-commuting entangling interaction (XX on │
│                          │ even edges, CRX on odd edges), which should enrich the entangling dynamics of the ring    │
│                          │ without any extra trainable parameters, potentially improving convergence speed and       │
│                          │ expressivity while preserving parameter economy.                                          │
