│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ localized_mini_block_wires0to3                                                            │
│ patch_description        │ The previous experiment showed that appending a small localized "mini-block" on qubits    │
│                          │ 0-3 (reusing the single shared "theta" parameter) after the main block dramatically       │
│                          │ improved convergence speed (30 steps vs 60) at a modest depth/gate-count cost, while      │
│                          │ keeping accuracy at 1.0 and parameter count unchanged. The current version dropped this   │
│                          │ mini-block in favor of a fully tunable ring (XX/CRX), which reduced depth/gate-count but  │
│                          │ regressed convergence back to 60 steps. This edit re-introduces the localized             │
│                          │ half-register mini-block (RX, RY, alternating XX/CZ on the 4-cycle 0-1-2-3-0, then RZ,    │
│                          │ all sharing "theta") appended after the final RZ layer, aiming to recover the faster      │
│                          │ 30-step convergence while retaining the more expressive full-ring entangler already       │
│                          │ present, at a smaller depth overhead than a full second block duplication.                │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0608                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 20; deleted: 0; modified: 0;                                                       │
